- /swap-outfit endpoint: SAM2 segments clothing mask, FLUX inpainting
  replaces only the clothing region — face, body, skin, hair and
  background are pixel-perfect identical to the locked master portrait
- Step 2: 'Swap outfit only' button alongside existing generate button
  with helper text explaining the difference between the two modes
- swapOutfitOnly() JS: polls portrait-status, shows result in existing
  portrait result grid, caches swapped portrait for video generation
- Background Music card moved from Step 5 into Step 3 (Voice) so users
  set music alongside the voiceover before moving to Scene/Generate

